  "rules": [
    "Five outer folds; donor/family components kept together; population balancing uses metadata only.",
    "Saudi cohort conservatively kept in one block pending complete relationship review.",
    "Known relatedness screen groups pairs with >=10000 shared sites and relatedness>=0.1; incomplete screens do not certify independence.",
    "No held-out donor contributes sequences, labels, weights, graph paths or parameter tuning. Fixed prior mapper configuration; no tuning on outer-fold results.",
    "This previously exposed cohort supports developmental CV, not an untouched final benchmark.",
    "IPD is a fixed external catalogue; identical sequences independently supplied by training donors are allowed.",
    "Primary typing target is four-field named alleles / exact gene sequence for unnamed alleles; lower-field calls do not count as four-field successes.",
    "Real reads preferred. Simulated reads are a separately labelled experiment and are not generated here."
  ],
